0,Emberá Baudó - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emberá_Baudó,"Baudó Emberá also known as Baudó is an Embera language of Colombia. It is partially intelligible with both Northern Embera and Eperara, and it is not clear which branch of Embera it belongs to.",Embera Baudó,Chocoan
1,Emberá languages - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emberá_languages,A case can be made for classifying Baudó in the Northern Embera group. It has many features of both groups and is partially intelligible with the neighboring Northern Embera dialect as well as with Epena.,Embera Baudó,Chocoan
